### Place an order (customer 4 is PLATINUM: the tier behind INC-01)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": 4, "sku": "KB-001", "quantity": 1}

### List orders (one SQL statement: the INC-02 fix)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders

### Out of stock -> 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": 1, "sku": "HD-004", "quantity": 50}

### Thread dump (what jstack would show)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/threaddump
Accept: text/plain
